    "description": "Butcher / meat hall, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 245 blocks vs 165. Stone butcher shop with a plaster gable: door between two serving windows, smoker (workstation), chopping table and meat hooks on a tie beam; L2 a striped awning, lanterns, salt barrel and sink; L3 a fenced holding pen with hay and trough, sign, banner and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: cauldron, cornflower, dandelion, fern, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner, red_wool, white_wool. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, item_frame, sign_text, water_cauldron.",
